<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joela</book>
  <para style="h">Joela</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joela</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joela</para>
  <para style="mt">Joela</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuela fapa Joela hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni upate u, hei hi ngaithla ula, Ram chhûnga mi zawng zawngte u, ngaihtuah rawh u: In hun lai leh in thlahtute hun lai khân Hetiang thil hi a lo thleng tawh rêng em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hei hi in fate hrilh ula, annin an fate hrilh sela, An fa lehte pawhin chhuan dang hrilh zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khau puangin thlai a rawn bawh a, Rual khatin an ei bâng chu rual dangin an rawn ei a, An ei bâng chu rual dangin an rawn ei fai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zu hehho, harh ula, ṭap vak vak rawh u, Uain hehho, chiau vawng vawng rawh u. Uain in tûr in nei dâwn tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khau rualin kan ram an tuam, chak tak an ni, Chhiar sên rual an ni lo; An ha chu sakeibaknei ha ang a ni a, An ngho pawh keipui ngho ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka grep hrui an tichhia a, Ka theipui kûng an ei kawlh, A pil an khel fai a, an ṭînsan a, A zârte chu a ro zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nulain a pasal hual thi a sûn angin Saiip puan sinin ṭap rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa ina hlan tûr uain te, thlai te a awm ta lo, Lalpa rawngbâwltu puithiamte pawh an lungngai zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lo a chhe zo va, lei a ro vek a, Buh a kawlh zo ta. Uain a hâw ta lo va, hriak pawh a thar ta hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lo nei mite u, lungngai ula, grep enkawltute u, ṭap rawh u, In lovah huit leh barli seng tûr a awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grep hrui a vuai a, theipui kûng a ro zo va, Theibuhfai te, tûm te, apple te, Lova thing tinrêng a ro zo ta, A ni, mite lâwmna pawh a chuai zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan Pathian rawngbâwltute u, ṭap vak vak rawh u, Lo kal ula, saiip puan sinin Zankhuain mu rawh u, In Pathian inah buh leh uain hlan tûr a awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chaw nghei nân awm ni kham ula, Khâwmpui lian buatsaih rawh u. Upate leh ram chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu In Pathian, Lalpa inah ko khâwm ula, Lalpa chu au chiam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A va pawi êm! Lalpa ni chu a lo hnai ta, Engkimtitheian chhiatna a rawn thlen dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan mit hmuh ngeiah ei tûr a awm ta lo, Kan Pathian ina hlim leh lâwmna chu a reh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei rovah thlai chu a chhe zo ta, Buh a ro avângin buh ina dah tûr a awm lo va, Chhêk inte pawh a ram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ramsate an mangang a, ranrual an chiai a, Hnim peh tûr rêng an nei ta lo, Berâm rual pawhin an tuar hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka au va che. Meiin phûla hnimte a kâng zo va, Lova thingte pawh a kâng ral ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ramsate pawhin tuihâlin an au che, Luikawrte a châr vek a, Phûl hnimte meiin a kâng zo ta si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion-ah tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Ka tlâng thianghlimah inrâlrin nân hâm rawh u. Ram chhûnga awm zawng zawng khûr sela, Lalpa ni a lo hnai ta, a thleng ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a dul ruih ang a, Chhûm a zîng ang a, khua a dur khup ang. Zîng khawvâra tlâng a lang ṭhut ang hian, Sipai rual lian tak, thiltithei tak an lo thawk ang. Chutiang thil chu tûn hmain a thleng ngai lo va, Tûn hnuah pawh a thleng tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram kâng angin an hma zâwn an ei zêl a, An kal pelh hnu chu mei kan fai ang a ni, An kal hma chuan ram chu Eden huan ang a ni a, An pelh hnu chuan thlalêr ram ro ang a ni ta, Eng mah zuah an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakawr rual ang mai an ni, Chak takin indo sakawr angin an tlân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Indo tawlailîr tlân ri sung sung angin Tlângchhîpahte an kat sup sup. Meiin buhpâwl a kâng hluah hluah ang leh Indo tûra sipai intlar pût ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hmabâka awmte chu an mangang a, An hmêl a ngui ruai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi huaisen angin hma an rawn sâwn a, Sipai angin bangah an lâwn sup sup a. Mahni hma zâwnah dîng takin an kal a, Tu mah an pêng buai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Innêk buai lovin mahni zâwnah zêl an kal a, Eng mahin an kawng a dâl zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawpui chhûngah an thlâwk lût a, Kulh bangah an vâk sup sup a, Inah an lâwn a, rûkru angin tukverhahte an lût.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An kalna lam apiangah lei a nghîng a, vân pawh a khûr, Ni leh thla a thim a, arsi a êng tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sipai rual thu a pe a, A hote chu chhiar sên rual an ni lo. A thu zâwmtute chu thiltithei tak an ni, Lalpa ni chu a ropui a, hlauhawm tak a ni, Tu nge dâwl zo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tûnah pawh,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni, Simin ka lam lo hawi rawh u, Chaw ngheiin ṭap ula, chiau vawng vawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In puan pawtthlêr lovin tihtakzetin inchhîr ula, Lalpa , in Pathian hnênah kîr leh rawh u; Ani chu khawngaihna ngah, lainatnaa khat, Thinnel tak leh hmangaihnaa khat a ni a; Thil ṭha lo thlentîr a hreh êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chuan a khawngaih leh ang che u a, In lam a lo hawi ang a, A hnêna hlan tûr buh leh uain in neih theih nân mal a sâwm lo vang che u tih tu nge hria?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion-ah tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Chaw nghei nân awmni kham rawh u, Khâwmpui lian buatsaih bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipui ko khâwm ula, pungkhâwmho chu thian thianghlim rawh u, Upate ko khâwm ula, Naupangte, hnute hne laite hruai khâwm rawh u. Moneitu chuan a pindan chhuahsan sela, Mo pawh a pindan ata lo chhuak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh puithiamte chu; Tempul hulhliap leh maichâm inkârah ṭap sela, “Aw Lalpa , i mite hi khawngaih la, I rochante hi hnam dang nuihzatbûr leh sawi nawmnaha an awm phal suh ang che; Engah nge chûng mite chuan, ‘Khawiah nge an Pathian chu?’ an tih ang le,” ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan a ram chu a rawn ngaihsak a, A mite pawh a khawngaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite chu heti hian a chhâng a: “Buh te, uain te, hriak te in kham khawpin ka pe ang che u, Hnam dangte ka hmuhsittîr tawh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmâr lam aṭanga rawn dotu che u chu Hla takah ka hnawh bosak ang che u a, Ram ruak, eng mah awm lohnaah ka kaltîr ang a, A hmasa pâwl chu khawchhak tuipuiah; A hnuhnûng pawl khawthlang tuifinriatah. An thi rim chu a nam vung vung ang. Nasa taka thil an tihchhiat avângin Anni pawh ka tichhe ve ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw leilung, hlau suh la, hlimin lâwm rawh, Lalpa chuan thil ropui tak a ti ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ramsate u, zâm suh u, ram rote chu hnimin a khat leh ta, Thingte pawh a rah tuar a, Theipui te, grep te a rah leh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zion-a awmte u, hlim rawh u, Lalpa , in Pathianah chuan lâwm rawh u, Ruah hmasa chu a tâwk têin a pe che u a; Tûn hma ang khân in tân ruah hnuhnûng a sûrtîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hruihzâwlahte buh a khat ang a, Sâwrkhurte pawh uain leh hriakin a liam zawih zawih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khau rualin a eichhiat vek kumte aiah Kum ṭhat kumte ka awmtîr leh ang. Khau puang, a rual ruala lo kal dûl dûlte kha Ka sipai rual, in hnêna ka rawn tirh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ei tûr in ngah ang a, in hnianghnâr ang, Tichuan, in zînga thil mak titu In Pathian, Lalpa hming chu in chawimawi ang. Ka mite chu an mualpho leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Israel-te zîngah ka chêng a, Lalpa , in Pathian chu ka ni, Pathian dang rêng an awm lo tih in hria ang, Ka mite chu an mualpho leh tawh ngai lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Chumi hnuah chuan, Mi zawng zawng chungah ka thlarau ka leih ang a, In fanu in fapaten ka thu an hril ang. In upaten mumangah an mang ang a, In tlangvâlten inlârnate an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng ni-ah chuan ka chhiahhlawh a hmei a pa chungah Ka thlarau ka leih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lei leh vânah chhinchhiahna mak tak tak ka lantîr ang a, Thisen te, mei te, meikhu ngun ngunte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni a thim ang a, thla pawh a sen khuih ang, Lalpa ni ropui leh râpthlâk tak a lo thlen hma chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu pawh Lalpa hming lam apiang chhandam an ni ang a, Zion tlâng leh Jerusalem-a mi ṭhenkhat chuan an pumpelh ang a, Ka mi thlante chu an him ang,” Lalpan a tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai teh, a hun leh a ni ruatah chuan, Judai ram leh Jerusalem chan chu ka tiṭha leh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam zawng zawng ka ko khâwm ang a, Jehosafat ruamah ka hruai khâwm ang. Tah chuan an chungthu ka rêl ang a, Ka rochan, ka mi Israel-te chu Hnam dang zîngah an hnawt darh a, Ka ram chu an insem darh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhum an vâwr a, ka mite an insem a, Mipa naupang nawhchizuar lei nân an hmang a, Hmeichhe naupang uain man atân an pe. An rui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangni, Tura leh Sidon khuaa awmte leh Filistia ram chhûnga awm zawng zawngte u, engtia mi tih nge in tum? Ka chungah phuba lâk in tum elo? In tum a nih zawngin na takin in chungah phuba ka la nghâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tangkarua leh rangkachak in la a, ka ro ṭha ṭha nên in tempulah in thiar lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ram ata hla taka an awm theih nân Judai rama mite leh Jerusalem-a awmte chu Grik mite hnênah in hralh ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh u, anni chu in hralh chhuahna ram ata ka hruai chhuak ang a, an chunga in tih angin ka thungrûl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In fanu leh in fapate chu Judai rama mite hnênah ka hralh ang a, annin ram hla taka awm Seba mite hnênah an hralh ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnamte zîngah hei hi puang rawh u, Indo tûrin inbuatsaih sela, Mi huaisente chu lo thawk rawh se, Indo mi zawng zawng lo hnai sela, rawn bei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In leilehna hmâwr zum chu khandaihah chher ula, In thei kûng hlawina chem kawm chu feiah siam rawh u, Mi chak lote pawhin, ‘Ka chak a ni,’ ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni ram chhehvêl hnam dang zawng zawngte u, Hmanhmawh takin lo kal ula, Pung khâwm rawh u. Tah chuan, aw Lalpa , i mi huaite rawn tîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnamte chu inrâlring sela, Jehosafat ruamah lo kal rawh se, Chutah chuan an vêla hnam dang zawng zawngte chu Ro ka rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An sual êm avângin favah ruai ula, Ât chhum vek rawh u, Sâwrkhur liam zawih zawiha uain an rap angin, Lo kal ula, rap hrep rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rorêlna ruamah mipui an tam mang e, Chutah chuan Lalpa ni a lo thleng thuai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni leh thla a thim ang a, Arsite pawh an êng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa thâwm chu Zion aṭangin a lo ri hum hum ang a, Jerusalem aṭangin a aw a chhuah ang, Lei leh vân a nghîng ang a, Mahse, Lalpa chuan a mite a hum ang a, Israel-te tân kulhbîng a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei, Lalpa hi i Pathian ka ni a, Ka tlâng thianghlim Zion-ah ka chêng tih i hria ang, Jerusalem chu hmun thianghlim a ni tawh ang. Hnam dangten an hneh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan tlângah grep a khat ang a, Mualahte pawh hnutetui a luang ang. Judai ram kawr zawng zawngah tui a luang ang a, Lalpa in aṭangin tuihna a lo chhuak ang a, Sitim ruam a châwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judai ram mite chungah râwng takin an che a, Pawi khawih lo thisente an chhuah avângin Aigupta ram chu a chhe vek ang a, Edom ram pawh thlalêr ram ro a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judai ram erawh chu an luah kumkhua ang a, Jerusalem pawh an luah reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thisen phuba ka la ang a, Thil tisual chu ka zuah lo vang, Lalpa chu Zion-ah a awm si a.
  </para>
</usx>
